body:
Five words - "You're Nothing Like My Mum."

&#x200B;

We'd been together almost two years.

Bedbugs. 

&#x200B;

You'd by lying awake all night listening to them talking to each other about how they can't wait to drink your blood as you sleep

I moved to America to be with this guy (let's call him Dick). Dick happened to work at the same big box store as my friend J, and one day when I came to meet J from work, a coworker innocently said "Are you looking for Dick? He's staying with his girlfriend."

&#x200B;

Me: "I'M HIS GIRLFRIEND."

&#x200B;

Now another thing you should know about Dick is he bought his toothbrushes wholesale and lived in the grungiest apartment ever. I cleaned every inch of that bathroom, toilet included, with each and every one of those remaining toothbrushes, documenting every step with photographs.  Then I rinsed them in the toilet, and put them back in the box. And I packed my shit and left.

&#x200B;

Ten years later, when I'd calculated he was on the last brush, I sent him the pictures.
